# Cline project rules

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` as the source of truth for Embervale priorities,
constraints, active tasks, and verification commands.

When asked for broad project improvement, select the highest-priority unchecked
task that produces a complete, testable player-facing slice. Do not start
several large refactors at once, do not redo the completed stylized-PBR/VFX
baseline, and do not modify unrelated uncommitted work.

Before finishing, update an `AGENTS.md` checkbox only if its acceptance is
genuinely met, run the affected validation, and report evidence rather than
assumptions.
